-28613?\u-28783?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 8\u12289?A\u-242?\u25511?\u21046?\u25551?\u-28688? \u160? \u160?B\u-242?\u-28781?\u20837?/\u-28781?\u20986?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?C\u-242?\u20989?\u25968?\u23450?\u20041? \u160? \u160?D\u-242?\u-28613?\u-28783?\u25512?\u29702?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160? XP is\f1\fs24\ul  \u160? 9 \u160? \ul0\f4\fs24 of interesting twists that encourage one to think--for example, how about "Test and then code"? I've worked with software companies and a few IT organizations in\f1\fs24\ul  \u160? 10 \u160? \ul0\f4\fs24 programmer performance was measured on lines of code delivered and testing was measured on defects found--\f1\fs24\ul  \u160? 11 \u160? \ul0\f4\fs24 side was motivated to reduce the number of defects prior to testing. \u160?XP uses two types of testing: unit and functional.\f1\fs24\ul  \u160? 12 \u160? \ul0\f4\fs24 , the practice for unit testing involves developing the test for the feature prior to writing the code and further states that the tests should be automated. Once the code is written, it is immediately\f1\fs24\ul  \u160? 13 \u160? \ul0\f4\fs24 to the test suite bringing instant feedback.\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 9\u12289? A. filled \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160?B. stuff \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160?C. pack \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160?D. full\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 10\u12289? A. them \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? B. where \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160?C. that \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160?D. which\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 11\u12289? A. subjected \u160? \u160? \u160? B. submitted \u160? \u160? \u160?C. sent \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160?D. suffered\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 12\u12289? A. both \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? B. neither \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? C. no \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? D. either\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 13\u12289? A. whereas \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160?B. Although \u160? \u160? \u160? C. However \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160? \u160?D. And then\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 14\u12289? \u26576?\u21333?\u20301?\u22312?\u-32692?\u30340?\u23567?\u31456?\u-244?\u22312?\u20570?\u22909?\u26412?\u-32692?\u24037?\u20316?\u20043?\u20313?\u-244?\u21463?\u-32680?\u20110?\u20854?\u20182?\u21333?\u20301?\u24182?\u21033?\u29992?\u-29723?\u21333?\u20301?\u25552?\u20379?\u30340?\u25216?\u26415?\u29289?\u-29400?\u26465?\u20214?\u24320?\u21457?\u23436?\u25104?\u20102?\u19968?\u31181?\u24212?\u29992?\u-28817?\u20214?\u12290?\u-29723?\u-28817?\u20214?\u-31657?\u20316?\u26435?\u23646?\u20110?\f1\fs24\ul  \u160?(22) \u160?\ul0\f4\fs24 \u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?A\u-242?\u23567?\u31456?\u30340?\u22312?\u-32692?\u21333?\u20301?\u25152?\u26377?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?B\u-242?\u23567?\u31456?\u30340?\u20860?\u-32692?\u21333?\u20301?\u25152?\u26377?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?C\u-242?\u23567?\u31456?\u30340?\u22312?\u-32692?\u21333?\u20301?\u21644?\u20860?\u-32692?\u21333?\u20301?\u20849?\u21516?\u25152?\u26377?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?D\u-242?\u23567?\u31456?\u20010?\u20154?\u25152?\u26377?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 15\u12289?\u-27512?\u23545?\u24212?\u29992?\u22312?\u-28720?\u-30644?\u26399?\u30340?\u25968?\u25454?\u29305?\u28857?\u-244?\u20462?\u25913?\u20854?\u25490?\u24207?\u31639?\u27861?\u20351?\u20854?\u26356?\u-25896?\u25928?\u-244?\u23646?\u20110?______\u32500?\u25252?\u12290?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?A\u-242?\u27491?\u30830?\u24615? \u160? \u160?B\u-242?\u-28670?\u24212?\u24615? \u160? \u160?C\u-242?\u23436?\u21892?\u24615? \u160? \u160?D\u-242?\u-26492?\u-27086?\u24615?\f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24 16\u12289?\u27010?\u-30335?\u-29762?\u-29791?\u26159?\u-28817?\u20214?\u31995?\u32479?\u32467?\u26500?\u30340?\u24635?\u20307?\u-29762?\u-29791?\u-244?\u20197?\u19979?\u19981?\u23646?\u20110?\u27010?\u-30335?\u-29762?\u-29791?\u30340?\u26159?______\u12290? \f4\fs24 \par \f4\fs24  \u160? \u160?A